OL,3,GNEWSARNLI issues 'check tide time' plea
OL,4,Aas pair rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RNLI has urged people to "check the
OL,7,Ftide times" after two people had to be
OL,8,Frescued from the sea in Merseyside.
OL,10,FWirral RNLI volunteers were called to
OL,11,Freports of two people cut off by a
OL,12,F"rapidly flooding tide" between the
OL,13,Fislands off West Kirby at 12:01 GMT on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe pair had become cut off between
OL,17,FLittle Eye and Middle Eye and took
OL,18,Frefuge on a rock between the islands
OL,19,Fwhile the lifeboat crew made their way
OL,20,Fto them. Both were brought safely back
OL,21,Fto shore.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
